  "No Objective. Starting cards as marked '(st)': Cloud City: Guest Quarters (posted 'CCGuest Chamber'; starting location), Don't Tread On Me, Ultimatum and 'There's No Try'; these count toward the 60 (total 60 as published). Two Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Posted 'There's No Try (st)' names the Dark Dagobah Effect There Is No Try; on this Light list it is dested the Light mirror card Do, Or Do Not (same Dagobah pair).",
  "Posted 'Rebel Lightsaber' matches no card (Jedi Lightsaber and Luke's Lightsaber are possible meanings); shown as posted and left out of GEMP (UNKNOWN).",
  "Posted 'Cloud City' dested Bespin: Cloud City; Coruscant is the Special Edition Light system; 'Biggs Darkligther' Biggs Darklighter; 'Derek 'Hobbie' Kivian' Derek 'Hobbie' Klivian; 'Han with H.B.P.' Han With Heavy Blaster Pistol; 'The Force is Strong ...' The Force Is Strong With This One; 'Star Destroyer' the Interrupt Star Destroyer!; 'Restaining Bolt' Restraining Bolt; Weapon Levitation is the Light Jabba's Palace Interrupt; Ultimatum is the Jabba's Palace Effect (not the later Defensive Shield)."
